# Fase 12, Checkpoint 1 (CI/CD Pipeline Hardening) — keeps the Docker build
# context to source only. Without this, `COPY . .` in docker/*.Dockerfile
# was dragging in every bin/obj folder produced by local/CI dotnet builds
# plus the full frontend node_modules and .git history, making "sending
# build context" the dominant cost of every image build.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
node_modules/
.git/
.vs/
.idea/
*.user

# Local-only, never needed inside a container image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.*.local.json
